#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:939
msgid ""
":ref:`Target Build Specification Properties <Target Build Specification>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:940
msgid ""
"These evaluate as a :ref:`semicolon-separated list <CMake Language Lists>` "
"representing the union of the value on the target itself with the values of "
"the corresponding :ref:`Target Usage Requirements` on targets named by the "
"target's :prop_tgt:`LINK_LIBRARIES`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:945
msgid ""
"For :ref:`Target Compile Properties`, evaluation of corresponding usage "
"requirements is transitive over the closure of the linked "
"targets' :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES` *excluding* entries guarded by "
"the :genex:`LINK_ONLY` generator expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:950
msgid ""
"For :ref:`Target Link Properties`, evaluation of corresponding usage "
"requirements is transitive over the closure of the linked "
"targets' :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES` *including* entries guarded by "
"the :genex:`LINK_ONLY` generator expression.  See policy :policy:`CMP0166`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:957
msgid ""
"Evaluation of :prop_tgt:`LINK_LIBRARIES` itself is now transitive. See "
"policy :policy:`CMP0189`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:960
msgid ":ref:`Target Usage Requirement Properties <Target Usage Requirements>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:961
msgid ""
"These evaluate as a :ref:`semicolon-separated list <CMake Language Lists>` "
"representing the union of the value on the target itself with the values of "
"the same properties on targets named by the "
"target's :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:966
msgid ""
"For :ref:`Transitive Compile Properties`, evaluation is transitive over the "
"closure of the target's :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES` *excluding* "
"entries guarded by the :genex:`LINK_ONLY` generator expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:970
msgid ""
"For :ref:`Transitive Link Properties`, evaluation is transitive over the "
"closure of the target's :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES` *including* "
"entries guarded by the :genex:`LINK_ONLY` generator expression. See "
"policy :policy:`CMP0166`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:977
msgid ""
"Evaluation of :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES` itself is now "
"transitive.  See policy :policy:`CMP0189`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:980
msgid ":ref:`Custom Transitive Properties`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:983
msgid "These are processed during evaluation as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:985
msgid ""
"Evaluation of :genex:`$<TARGET_PROPERTY:tgt,PROP>` for some property "
"``PROP``, named without an ``INTERFACE_`` prefix, checks "
"the :prop_tgt:`TRANSITIVE_COMPILE_PROPERTIES` "
"and :prop_tgt:`TRANSITIVE_LINK_PROPERTIES` properties on target ``tgt``, on "
"targets named by its :prop_tgt:`LINK_LIBRARIES`, and on the transitive "
"closure of targets named by the linked "
"targets' :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:993
msgid ""
"If ``PROP`` is listed by one of those properties, then it evaluates as "
"a :ref:`semicolon-separated list <CMake Language Lists>` representing the "
"union of the value on the target itself with the values of the corresponding "
"``INTERFACE_PROP`` on targets named by the "
"target's :prop_tgt:`LINK_LIBRARIES`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:999
msgid ""
"If ``PROP`` is named by :prop_tgt:`TRANSITIVE_COMPILE_PROPERTIES`, "
"evaluation of the corresponding ``INTERFACE_PROP`` is transitive over the "
"closure of the linked targets' :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES`, "
"excluding entries guarded by the :genex:`LINK_ONLY` generator expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:1004
msgid ""
"If ``PROP`` is named by :prop_tgt:`TRANSITIVE_LINK_PROPERTIES`, evaluation "
"of the corresponding ``INTERFACE_PROP`` is transitive over the closure of "
"the linked targets' :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES`, including entries "
"guarded by the :genex:`LINK_ONLY` generator expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:1009
msgid ""
"Evaluation of :genex:`$<TARGET_PROPERTY:tgt,INTERFACE_PROP>` for some "
"property ``INTERFACE_PROP``, named with an ``INTERFACE_`` prefix, checks "
"the :prop_tgt:`TRANSITIVE_COMPILE_PROPERTIES` "
"and :prop_tgt:`TRANSITIVE_LINK_PROPERTIES` properties on target ``tgt``, and "
"on the transitive closure of targets named by "
"its :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:1016
msgid ""
"If the corresponding ``PROP`` is listed by one of those properties, then "
"``INTERFACE_PROP`` evaluates as a :ref:`semicolon-separated list <CMake "
"Language Lists>` representing the union of the value on the target itself "
"with the value of the same property on targets named by the "
"target's :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:1023
msgid ""
"If ``PROP`` is named by :prop_tgt:`TRANSITIVE_COMPILE_PROPERTIES`, "
"evaluation of the corresponding ``INTERFACE_PROP`` is transitive over the "
"closure of the target's :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES`, excluding "
"entries guarded by the :genex:`LINK_ONLY` generator expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:1028
msgid ""
"If ``PROP`` is named by :prop_tgt:`TRANSITIVE_LINK_PROPERTIES`, evaluation "
"of the corresponding ``INTERFACE_PROP`` is transitive over the closure of "
"the target's :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES`, including entries guarded "
"by the :genex:`LINK_ONLY` generator expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:1033
msgid ""
"If a ``PROP`` is named by both :prop_tgt:`TRANSITIVE_COMPILE_PROPERTIES` "
"and :prop_tgt:`TRANSITIVE_LINK_PROPERTIES`, the latter takes precedence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:1036
msgid ":ref:`Compatible Interface Properties`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.rst:1037
msgid ""
"These evaluate as a single value combined from the target itself, from "
"targets named by the target's :prop_tgt:`LINK_LIBRARIES`, and from the "
"transitive closure of the linked "
"targets' :prop_tgt:`INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES`.  Values of a compatible "
"interface property from multiple targets combine based on the type of "
"compatibility required by the ``COMPATIBLE_INTERFACE_*`` property defining "
"it."
msgstr ""

